{"id":"254200a991dbb642","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-provability-predicate.md","title":"Provability Predicate","display":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-provability-predicate","aliases":["88-df-provability-predicate"],"display":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate","depends_on":["[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","[[88-df-theory]]","[[88-df-derivation]]","[[88-df-inference-rule]]","[[88-df-arithmetical-formula]]","[[88-df-free-variable]]","[[88-df-numeral]]","[[88-df-representable]]","[[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[88-df-provable]]","[[88-df-substitution]]","[[88-df-max-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-provability-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-provability-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"88-df-godel-numbering\">88-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"86a742fad2207b40\" href=\"?note=86a742fad2207b40\" title=\"88-df-derivation\">88-df-derivation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"14e11c6d19d5648b\" href=\"?note=14e11c6d19d5648b\" title=\"88-df-representable\">88-df-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3f44d69945b890a4\" href=\"?note=3f44d69945b890a4\" title=\"88-df-robinson-arithmetic\">88-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a72f024d8daeb569\" href=\"?note=a72f024d8daeb569\" title=\"88-df-substitution\">88-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ed30454d43d18f4c\" href=\"?note=ed30454d43d18f4c\" title=\"88-df-max-function\">88-df-max-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-provability-predicate-—-Provability-Predicate-$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$\">df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,R,g\">\\(T,R,g\\)</span> (candidate theory, proof calculus, and Gödel coding)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithForm}\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithForm}\\)</span> (arithmetic-formula set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\)</span> (proof-rule predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\)</span> (Gödel-numbering predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)\">\\(\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)\\)</span> (finite derivation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"86a742fad2207b40\" href=\"?note=86a742fad2207b40\" title=\"88-df-derivation\">88-df-derivation</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofCode}_{T,R,g}(y,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofCode}_{T,R,g}(y,x)\\)</span> (metatheoretic proof-code relation)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvCode}_{T,R,g}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvCode}_{T,R,g}(x)\\)</span> (metatheoretic set of theorem codes)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofRel}_{T,R,g}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofRel}_{T,R,g}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> (extension of the proof-code relation)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (Robinson arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"3f44d69945b890a4\" href=\"?note=3f44d69945b890a4\" title=\"88-df-robinson-arithmetic\">88-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(u,v)\">\\(\\pi(u,v)\\)</span> (candidate formula representing the proof-code relation)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RepBy}_{Q,R}\">\\(\\mathrm{RepBy}_{Q,R}\\)</span> (representation-by predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr(v)\">\\(\\Pr(v)\\)</span> (candidate object-language provability formula)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\)</span> (Hilbert--Bernays derivability-condition predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\">\\(\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\)</span> (standard-provability-formula predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在算术解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdProv}\">\\(\\mathrm{StdProv}\\)</span> 中固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(u,v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\neq v\">\\(u\\neq v\\)</span>；在前面的一般证明编码定义中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 保持为其原来的数词签名参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr(v)\">\\(\\Pr(v)\\)</span> 记固定公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr\">\\(\\Pr\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr(t)\">\\(\\Pr(t)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[t/v]\">\\(\\Pr[t/v]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(u,v)\">\\(\\pi(u,v)\\)</span> 记固定公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>。这些是句法公式及其 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"a72f024d8daeb569\" href=\"?note=a72f024d8daeb569\" title=\"88-df-substitution\">88-df-substitution</a> 代入，不是数值函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RepBy}_{Q,R}(\\mathrm{ProofRel}_{T,R,g},\\pi;u,v)\">\\(\\mathrm{RepBy}_{Q,R}(\\mathrm{ProofRel}_{T,R,g},\\pi;u,v)\\)</span> 按二元关系实例解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>自然数集合的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max\">\\(\\max\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"ed30454d43d18f4c\" href=\"?note=ed30454d43d18f4c\" title=\"88-df-max-function\">88-df-max-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)\">\\(\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)\\)</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(d)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(d)\\)</span> 为非空有限自然数集。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProofCode}_{T,R,g}(y,x)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\ny,x\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)\n\\land y=g(d)\n\\land x=g\\bigl(d(\\max\\operatorname{dom}(d))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProofCode}_{T,R,g}(y,x)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\ny,x\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)\n\\land y=g(d)\n\\land x=g\\bigl(d(\\max\\operatorname{dom}(d))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProvCode}_{T,R,g}(x)\n\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{ProofCode}_{T,R,g}(y,x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProvCode}_{T,R,g}(x)\n\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{ProofCode}_{T,R,g}(y,x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProofRel}_{T,R,g}\\coloneqq\n\\{(y,x)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\mathrm{ProofCode}_{T,R,g}(y,x)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProofRel}_{T,R,g}\\coloneqq\n\\{(y,x)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\mathrm{ProofCode}_{T,R,g}(y,x)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HB}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\Pr(v)\\in\\mathrm{ArithForm}\n\\land\\mathrm{free}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\Pr(v))=\\{v\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\;\\Bigl[\n(T\\vdash_R\\sigma\\to\nT\\vdash_R\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma)}))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land T\\vdash_R\\bigl(\n\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma\\to\\tau)})\\to\n(\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma)})\\to\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\tau)}))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land T\\vdash_R\\bigl(\n\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma)})\\to\n\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma)}))})\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HB}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\Pr(v)\\in\\mathrm{ArithForm}\n\\land\\mathrm{free}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\Pr(v))=\\{v\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\;\\Bigl[\n(T\\vdash_R\\sigma\\to\nT\\vdash_R\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma)}))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land T\\vdash_R\\bigl(\n\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma\\to\\tau)})\\to\n(\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma)})\\to\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\tau)}))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land T\\vdash_R\\bigl(\n\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma)})\\to\n\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma)}))})\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{HB}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\pi(u,v)\\in\\mathrm{ArithForm}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RepBy}_{Q,R}(\\mathrm{ProofRel}_{T,R,g},\\pi;u,v)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\n\\Pr(v)=\\exists u\\;\\pi(u,v)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{HB}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\pi(u,v)\\in\\mathrm{ArithForm}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RepBy}_{Q,R}(\\mathrm{ProofRel}_{T,R,g},\\pi;u,v)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\land\n\\Pr(v)=\\exists u\\;\\pi(u,v)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofCode}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofCode}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvCode}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvCode}\\)</span> 是元层自然数谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr\">\\(\\Pr\\)</span> 是对象语言公式，不能把二者当成同一个函数。原定义仍直接编码有限公式推导表；它没有给可枚举公理的出现附加阶段证书，末项仍允许原定义中的公式，未另加句子限制。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdProv}\">\\(\\mathrm{StdProv}\\)</span> 保留原有两个要求：二元证明关系由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 中逐数词强表示，以及三个 Hilbert--Bernays 条件。本谓词没有限制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 的句法复杂度，所以不能仅从它推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr\">\\(\\Pr\\)</span> 属于这里定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{fml}}_1\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{fml}}_1\\)</span>。它也没有断言每个可枚举公理集都存在这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>；原始推导表的可判定性需要另查。此处不为追求常见的“标准可证性谓词”版本而改变既有证明对象或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdProv}\">\\(\\mathrm{StdProv}\\)</span> 的断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-provability-predicate-—-Provability-Predicate-$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$","text":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate $\\mathrm{Prov}_T$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"def3025c6c81c740","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"86a742fad2207b40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"c7ab6c8e893872fb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-inference-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0084b7b825c6c2d7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-arithmetical-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b642ab331635c77d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-