hrm{RepBy}_{Q,R}(\\mathrm{ProofRel}_{T,R,g},\\pi;u,v)$ 按二元关系实例解释。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-max-function","status":"resolved","id":"ed30454d43d18f4c","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"自然数集合的 $\\max$ 取 [[88-df-max-function]]；$\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)$ 保证 $\\operatorname{dom}(d)$ 为非空有限自然数集。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T,R,g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithForm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofCode}_{T,R,g}(y,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvCode}_{T,R,g}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofRel}_{T,R,g}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi(u,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RepBy}_{Q,R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StdProv}","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"u\\neq v","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr[t/v]","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi(u,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RepBy}_{Q,R}(\\mathrm{ProofRel}_{T,R,g},\\pi;u,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\max","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProofCode}_{T,R,g}(y,x)\\leftrightarrow{}&\ny,x\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{<\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{DerivSeq}_{T,R}(d)\n\\land y=g(d)\n\\land x=g\\bigl(d(\\max\\operatorname{dom}(d))\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProvCode}_{T,R,g}(x)\n\\leftrightarrow\nx\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{ProofCode}_{T,R,g}(y,x)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProofRel}_{T,R,g}\\coloneqq\n\\{(y,x)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\mathrm{ProofCode}_{T,R,g}(y,x)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HB}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\Pr(v)\\in\\mathrm{ArithForm}\n\\land\\mathrm{free}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\Pr(v))=\\{v\\}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\;\\Bigl[\n(T\\vdash_R\\sigma\\to\nT\\vdash_R\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma)}))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land T\\vdash_R\\bigl(\n\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma\\to\\tau)})\\to\n(\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma)})\\to\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\tau)}))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land T\\vdash_R\\bigl(\n\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma)})\\to\n\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\Pr(\\overline{g(\\sigma)}))})\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{StdProv}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Godel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(g)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{HB}_{T,R,g}(\\Pr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists\\pi(u,v)\\in\\mathrm{ArithForm}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RepBy}_{Q,R}(\\mathrm{ProofRel}_{T,R,g},\\pi;u,v)\\\\\n&\\hspace{9em}\\land\n\\Pr(v)=\\exists u\\;\\pi(u,v)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofCode}","display":fa